{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13027","headline":"送李将军赴定州 · 郎士元","name":"送李将军赴定州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双旌汉飞将，万里授横戈。\n春色临边尽，黄云出塞多。\n鼓鼙悲绝漠，烽戍隔长河。\n莫断阴山路，天骄已请和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「送李将军赴定州」条，撰者滕伟明、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"滕伟明"}